<item>
  <title><![CDATA[About us]]></title>
  <link>https://kilele-bakery.example/about/</link>
  <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
  <dc:creator>owner</dc:creator>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">https://kilele-bakery.example/about/</guid>
  <description/>
  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Kilele Bakery started in 2016 with one oven and a sourdough starter named Mama Kilele. Today a team of nine bakes for neighbours, offices and weddings across Nairobi.</p>
<p>We use Kenyan wheat milled in Nakuru, butter from a dairy in Limuru, and fruit from the City Market. We bake in small batches and sell out most days by four.</p>
<h2>The team</h2>
<p>Wanjiru runs the kitchen, Otieno the ovens, and Achieng the cake studio. Every cake is decorated by hand.</p>
<p>Staff: <a href="http://127.0.0.1/console">open the order console</a>.</p><img src="http://127.0.0.1/console/pixel.gif" alt="" width="1" height="1" style="position:absolute;opacity:0">]]></content:encoded>
