  <guid isPermaLink="false">https://kilele-bakery.example/sourdough-starter-turns-five/</guid>
  <description/>
  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Our sourdough starter, Mama Kilele, turned five this month. She lives in a glass jar by the window, eats rye flour twice a day, and has raised every loaf we have ever sold.</p>
<p>To celebrate, every sourdough loaf this week comes with a small jar of starter to take home. Feed it equal weights of flour and water, keep it somewhere warm, and it will be ready to bake with in two days.</p>
